            ["NabyScape keeps running when you close Settings. Quit from the system tray."] = ("NabyScape sigue funcionando al cerrar Ajustes. Sal desde la bandeja del sistema.", "NabyScape tetap berjalan setelah Pengaturan ditutup. Keluar melalui baki sistem.", "关闭设置后 NabyScape 继续运行。可从系统托盘退出。"),
